      "start_time": 12.6,
      "end_time": 14.5,
      "text": "No, hiding's no good. Let's run!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 15.2,
      "end_time": 17.6,
      "text": "It looked like they were all heading somewhere!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 18.0,
      "end_time": 20.6,
      "text": "If we stay here, they might trample right over us!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 20.8,
      "end_time": 22.2,
      "text": "Th-then let's run!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 22.7,
      "end_time": 24.8,
      "text": "Oh no... I don't wanna die!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 25.2,
      "end_time": 25.9,
      "text": "Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 26.4,
      "end_time": 29.3,
      "text": "Let's start with... a smokescreen!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 30.1,
      "end_time": 31.0,
      "text": "Hahhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 38.4,
      "end_time": 39.8,
      "text": "There! Quick, let's move!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 41.1,
      "end_time": 42.5,
      "text": "Run as fast as you can!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 42.8,
      "end_time": 46.8,
      "text": "Okay! Everyone be careful not to trip up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 47.5,
      "end_time": 50.7,
      "text": "You two are surprisingly reliable in a crisis..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 53.3,
      "end_time": 57.3,
      "text": "*huff*... *puff*..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 59.0,
      "end_time": 62.4,
      "text": "Haha, or maybe I just panicked too much..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 62.6,
      "end_time": 65.5,
      "text": "This is no time for deep breaths! Run!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
